{"id":328313,"bangumiId":328313,"type":2,"name":"世界最高の暗殺者、異世界貴族に転生する","name_cn":"世界顶尖的暗杀者转生为异世界贵族","date":"2021-10-06","year":"2021","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg"},"summary":"世界第一的暗杀者投胎成暗杀世家的长男重生了。作为能够转生到异世界的条件，他接下了女神给下达的唯一一项任务。\r\n那就是“杀了被预言会带给人类灾厄的‘勇者’”。\r\n这是曾经世界上最强暗杀者在新的人生中必须要完成的使命。在现代曾让万般暗杀方式变得可行的广泛知识及经验，还有暗杀者家族被誉为异世界最强的秘术与魔法。一切都相辅相成，使他逐步成为史上无人能及的暗杀者——\r\n“有意思，真没想到转生后还要继续从事暗杀工作啊”\r\n得以转生的“传说中的暗杀者”向更高境界进发！突破极限的冒险幻想谭，现在开幕！！","rating":{"rank":7396,"total":8669,"count":{"1":31,"2":40,"3":120,"4":344,"5":1460,"6":3608,"7":2374,"8":515,"9":62,"10":115},"score":6.1},"collection":{"on_hold":458,"dropped":707,"wish":1171,"collect":15383,"doing":1004},"tags":[{"name":"异世界","count":2398,"total_count":276497},{"name":"龙傲天","count":1566,"total_count":41047},{"name":"2021年10月","count":1334,"total_count":23501},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1288,"total_count":512578},{"name":"后宫","count":1255,"total_count":313447},{"name":"战斗","count":971,"total_count":494818},{"name":"SILVERLINK.","count":893,"total_count":36901},{"name":"TV","count":795,"total_count":1455564},{"name":"奇幻","count":680,"total_count":497100},{"name":"穿越","count":486,"total_count":66460},{"name":"2021","count":462,"total_count":80781},{"name":"轻改","count":452,"total_count":156765},{"name":"小说改","count":217,"total_count":169814},{"name":"日本","count":146,"total_count":319868},{"name":"田村正文","count":123,"total_count":391},{"name":"上田麗奈","count":73,"total_count":862},{"name":"厕纸","count":57,"total_count":12967},{"name":"2021年","count":31,"total_count":3721},{"name":"转生","count":30,"total_count":5998},{"name":"恋爱","count":29,"total_count":588153},{"name":"世界顶尖的暗杀者转生为异世界贵